  "create_refinery_n_reactors.ponder.shared.guide.industrial_dispatch.title": "交付工业产品",
  "create_refinery_n_reactors.ponder.shared.guide.industrial_dispatch.step_1": "将发货单装在物品保险库上，右击选下一订单，潜行右击选上一订单。",
  "create_refinery_n_reactors.ponder.shared.guide.industrial_dispatch.step_2": "漏斗、列车及解包机照常向保险库供货。流体订单经调度板的标准管道接口接收散装燃料。",
  "create_refinery_n_reactors.ponder.shared.guide.industrial_dispatch.step_3": "仅在货物完整时发运。用漏斗从调度板取出绿宝石报酬；报酬槽已满会暂停交货，不消耗货物。",
  "create_refinery_n_reactors.ponder.shared.guide.industrial_dispatch.step_4": "用列车或包裹持续补给，交货后进入下一订单，红石可暂停。",
  "create_refinery_n_reactors.ponder.quarry_frame.header": "在驱动端设置采石范围",
  "create_refinery_n_reactors.ponder.plant_industrial_dispatch.header": "交付工业产品",
  "create_refinery_n_reactors.ponder.shared.guide.manufacturing_mining_explosives.step_3": "用氨与硝酸制取硝酸铵。硝酸所需氧气和水可沿JEI配方追溯。\n%s → %s",
  "create_refinery_n_reactors.ponder.shared.guide.manufacturing_mining_explosives.step_4": "将硝酸铵、木炭和硫粉合成为火药。\n%s → %s",
  "create_refinery_n_reactors.ponder.shared.guide.manufacturing_mining_explosives.step_5": "将硝酸制造系列得到的硝酸铵与柴油在工作盆中混合，收集ANFO。\n%s → %s",
  "create_refinery_n_reactors.ponder.shared.guide.manufacturing_mining_explosives.step_6": "将ANFO、纸与红石组合为已有采矿炸药物品。\n%s → %s",
  "create_refinery_n_reactors.ponder.shared.quarry_frame.outlet": "回收驱动端旁传送带末端抛出的矿石，运输堵塞且钻头料箱装满时会保留物品并停止采掘。",
  "block.create_refinery_n_reactors.quarry_drive": "采石场驱动器",
  "crane.create_refinery_n_reactors.quarry_frame": "长%s×宽%s，支腿最高%s层",
  "crane.create_refinery_n_reactors.quarry_flow": "料箱 %s个，运送中 %s批",
  "crane.create_refinery_n_reactors.quarry_eta": "预计采掘剩余时间：%s",
  "crane.create_refinery_n_reactors.quarry_eta_measuring": "正在测算采掘剩余时间",
  "create_refinery_n_reactors.ponder.shared.quarry_frame.work_time": "采掘机启动后会保持作业区域加载，直到传送带上的物品运完。戴护目镜查看驱动端可见预计剩余采掘时间。",
  "create_refinery_n_reactors.ponder.shared.quarry_frame.pumping": "采掘机在开挖每一列前会自动清除水和熔岩。",
  "create_refinery_n_reactors.ponder.shared.quarry_frame.belt": "长距离输出由多条不超过配置上限的普通传送带连接，需补给传送带连接器、传动杆和封装链传动箱。",
  "create_refinery_n_reactors.ponder.shared.quarry_frame.belt_repair": "与输出路线尺寸相符的反向水平传送带会自动修复，保留货物并恢复采掘。",
  "create_refinery_n_reactors.ponder.shared.quarry_frame.belt_repair.lesson_pages.count": "1",
  "create_refinery_n_reactors.ponder.shared.quarry_frame.belt_repair.lesson_pages.0": "与输出路线尺寸相符的反向水平传送带会自动修复，保留货物并恢复采掘。",
  "create_refinery_n_reactors.ponder.shared.quarry_frame.belt_repair.lesson_pages.1": "与输出路线尺寸相符的反向水平传送带会自动修复，保留货物并恢复采掘。",
  "create_refinery_n_reactors.ponder.shared.quarry_frame.flow": "伸缩溜槽将矿石提升至运动的桥架传送带，再交给侧面传送带。停止旋转动力时，运输和桥架传送带都会停止。",
  "create_refinery_n_reactors.ponder.shared.quarry_frame.size": "关闭红石，在外侧两个面用扳手设置长度和宽度，每个数值表示向该面反方向采掘的距离。",
  "create_refinery_n_reactors.ponder.shared.quarry_frame.missing": "戴护目镜查看驱动端可见建造与运输所缺部件，已安装部件及库存会自动扣除。",
  "create_refinery_n_reactors.ponder.shared.quarry_frame.power": "从矿坑内侧输入旋转动力并打开拉杆，驱动端自动建造框架和安装库存钻头。",
  "create_refinery_n_reactors.ponder.shared.quarry_frame.stop": "断开红石可暂停采掘，停止旋转还会暂停运输，恢复信号与旋转即可继续。",
  "crane.create_refinery_n_reactors.quarry_frame_missing": "缺少：金属梁%s、钻头%s",
